BT /F1 10 Tf 46 564 Td (disagree, intermediate-switch counters disagree, delivery has missing packets, or duplicates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46 550 Td (appear. Only its own switch and capture processes are stopped in cleanup.) Tj ET
