BT /F1 10 Tf 46 466 Td (reproduces tuples and sizes, but BMv2 random choices and host scheduling can vary. Software-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46 452 Td (switch queueing and CPU contention can alter balance, delay, and reordering. Flowlet ordering) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46 438 Td (depends on the actual worst-case delay difference, not just nominal link delay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46 424 Td (The educational pipeline supports Ethernet, fixed-header IPv4, and unfragmented UDP. It does) Tj ET
